WEBVTT

00:15:58.704 --> 00:16:00.580
write postcards, make phone calls,

00:16:00.622 --> 00:16:02.749
knock on doors,

00:16:02.749 --> 00:16:04.042
can make that happen.

00:16:04.084 --> 00:16:06.920
And even run for office,

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.631
because that's what we need to do.

00:16:09.965 --> 00:16:16.805
Now while dire, the end of Roe
is not the end of the story.

00:16:17.472 --> 00:16:20.183
To paraphrase Joan Baez,

00:16:20.183 --> 00:16:24.521
the best antidote to despair is action.

00:16:25.022 --> 00:16:26.773
And your action,

00:16:26.773 --> 00:16:29.192
your willingness to work hard

00:16:29.234 --> 00:16:33.196
cannot only preserve reproductive
freedoms for ourselves